{
    "title": "MADFUT 24",
    "description": "Brand new MADFUT 24 is here! This is our best app ever, with more content, new modes and big improvements throughout the whole app.\r\n\r\nSome highlights of the new app:\r\n\u2022 Draft Ranks: earn Draft Building Points (DBP) from every draft to progress through Weekly Ranks and complete Daily Rewards.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy Limited Time Modes and LTM Cards already from the start! The first LTM is Higher/Lower.\r\n\u2022 Unlock unique Special Badges, set them as your club's badge and earn great rewards.\r\n\u2022 Complete all past Drafts Of The Day that you might have missed.\r\n\u2022 Adjust LTM cards' ratings up and down.\r\n\u2022 Play Online Draft Cups either in the original knock-out style or in the new League style.\r\n\u2022 Sort cards by their Fatal stats to build your best teams.\r\n\u2022 \"Jump to result\" in Fatal matches once the result has been determined.\r\n\u2022 Take advantage of improvements in SBC building, such as as detailed card information and quick search suggestions.\r\n\u2022 Earn a 100% distinction for completing the full collection.\r\n\u2022 Enjoy new Packs, Player Picks and Token selection.\r\n\r\nWe are so excited about this new generation of MADFUT, and we can't wait to bring you more content, features, modes and events this season than ever before.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Brand new MADFUT 24 is here! This is our best app ever, with more content, new modes and big improvements throughout the whole app.<br><br>Some highlights of the new app:<br>\u2022 Draft Ranks: earn Draft Building Points (DBP) from every draft to progress through Weekly Ranks and complete Daily Rewards.<br>\u2022 Enjoy Limited Time Modes and LTM Cards already from the start! The first LTM is Higher/Lower.<br>\u2022 Unlock unique Special Badges, set them as your club&#39;s badge and earn great rewards.<br>\u2022 Complete all past Drafts Of The Day that you might have missed.<br>\u2022 Adjust LTM cards&#39; ratings up and down.<br>\u2022 Play Online Draft Cups either in the original knock-out style or in the new League style.<br>\u2022 Sort cards by their Fatal stats to build your best teams.<br>\u2022 &quot;Jump to result&quot; in Fatal matches once the result has been determined.<br>\u2022 Take advantage of improvements in SBC building, such as as detailed card information and quick search suggestions.<br>\u2022 Earn a 100% distinction for completing the full collection.<br>\u2022 Enjoy new Packs, Player Picks and Token selection.<br><br>We are so excited about this new generation of MADFUT, and we can&#39;t wait to bring you more content, features, modes and events this season than ever before.",
